<title>USA: UNC Inc sees strong second half.</title>
<headline>UNC Inc sees strong second half.</headline>
<dateline>ANNAPOLIS, Md. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNC Inc said Wednesday that it expects favorable industry trends will result in a strong second second performance by the company.</p>
<p>The company said merger activity cut into some of its profit growth in the quarter but overall strong trends and robust growth in the aviation industry and deliveries of industrial power equipment led it to anticipate a continued strong second half performance.</p>
<p>UNC today reported second quarter earnings per share nearly doubled to $0.13 per share from $0.07 a year ago.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
